# Fixture lockfiles. Every testdata crate is dependency-free, so its lockfile
# pins nothing and is regenerated by each harness run — committing them would
# be pure churn. Real dependency lockfiles are not covered by this pattern.
/rust-helper/testdata/*/Cargo.lock
